WEBVTT

00:01.570 --> 00:05.880
You wish to return to the forest 
to find your lost hairpin?

00:05.880 --> 00:06.730
Yes.

00:07.280 --> 00:10.710
I'm aware it's an indulgent request.

00:10.710 --> 00:11.490
However, I...

00:11.490 --> 00:13.460
I wouldn't particularly mind.

00:13.460 --> 00:14.200
Oh?

00:14.560 --> 00:18.480
Your Highness did create an 
opportunity to withdraw my soldiers.

00:18.480 --> 00:19.790
I am in your debt.

00:21.540 --> 00:24.170
If you would be satisfied 
with me alone, I'll take you.

00:24.170 --> 00:26.510
We wouldn't want to bring 
the troops back there.

00:26.510 --> 00:29.250
J-Just the two of us, you mean?!

00:29.710 --> 00:32.700
<i>To start with, he's the one who...</i>

00:33.740 --> 00:37.010
This is serious!

02:07.310 --> 02:13.320
<b>Episode 8: Princess Mia Grins Slyly</b>

02:09.280 --> 02:10.350
Centurion Dion.

02:11.460 --> 02:13.770
Ah, Mr. Ludwig.

02:14.080 --> 02:16.740
There's something I'd like to ask of you.

02:17.250 --> 02:18.110
What is it?

02:18.800 --> 02:21.200
Once this incident is taken care of,

02:21.200 --> 02:24.200
I'd like you to become another 
of Her Highness's collaborators.

02:24.490 --> 02:25.700
Collaborators?

02:26.240 --> 02:30.540
Do you mean join the imperial guard 
and protect Her Imperial Highness?

02:30.960 --> 02:35.000
No. I'd like to have you become a general.

02:35.250 --> 02:38.470
What? Me? A g-general?!

02:38.780 --> 02:41.290
For Her Highness to accomplish her goals,

02:41.290 --> 02:43.550
she'll need allies in the military as well.

02:43.890 --> 02:46.270
You're telling me to 
climb the ranks for that?

02:47.370 --> 02:49.940
I've never really been interested 
in that sort of thing.

02:51.130 --> 02:54.190
Well, I suppose that could be exciting, too.

02:55.870 --> 02:57.150
Mr. Dion.

02:57.980 --> 03:01.540
Not that anything I say 
about it now means anything.

03:01.540 --> 03:04.620
There's no guarantee that 
I'll come back from the forest alive.

03:06.360 --> 03:09.440
What is that smirk about?

03:09.440 --> 03:12.540
Oh, nothing. Something trivial, really.

03:12.950 --> 03:17.420
Her Highness is certain to pull this off, 
so it's a waste of your energy to worry.

03:17.870 --> 03:19.880
Something along those lines?

03:20.200 --> 03:24.600
It rather appeared to me that <i>you</i> were 
the one thinking along those lines.

03:34.610 --> 03:36.770
<i>The forest at night is 
scary enough on its own!</i>

03:36.770 --> 03:41.210
<i>Why do I have to be here alone 
with this cold, unfeeling man?!</i>

03:41.210 --> 03:42.170
You know...

03:43.020 --> 03:45.870
Your plan has a very important 
hole in it, Your Highness.

03:47.250 --> 03:51.640
Things fall apart at the whole 
"let's look for something in the dark" stage.

03:51.640 --> 03:54.380
That's sloppy as an excuse 
to go into the forest at night.

03:54.650 --> 03:56.370
Not thought all the way through.

03:56.370 --> 03:57.340
Huh?

03:57.840 --> 04:02.420
You're really here to negotiate with 
the tribe yourself in secret, right?

04:03.120 --> 04:03.880
Huh?

04:04.150 --> 04:05.950
Oh? Are you not?

04:06.410 --> 04:09.220
Since you summoned me when 
I was relaxing and having a drink,

04:09.220 --> 04:12.490
I figured I ought to expect 
something like that.

04:12.490 --> 04:15.400
Y-You got me. Of course I am.

04:15.910 --> 04:17.260
I had an inkling.

04:17.830 --> 04:21.730
Well, although I don't know what exactly 
you plan to do, I'll accompany you.

04:21.730 --> 04:24.110
Even into hell if the situation calls for it.

04:24.600 --> 04:29.450
<i>Uh-oh... Could it be 
I'm headed for some trouble?</i>

04:29.800 --> 04:31.410
Hey! Miss me?

04:32.090 --> 04:33.120
Your Highness.

04:34.120 --> 04:35.930
Wh-What is it?!

04:35.930 --> 04:39.500
We've arrived at the spot 
where we were attacked. That's all

04:39.860 --> 04:43.710
O-Oh, is that so? I see.

04:44.320 --> 04:47.430
Is this really the same spot?

04:47.750 --> 04:49.210
No doubt about it.

04:49.640 --> 04:52.380
See? There's an arrow mark on that tree.

04:53.390 --> 04:56.560
<i>Whatever the case, I need to find it fast...</i>

04:57.370 --> 05:01.400
Your Highness, it would appear 
you're about to get what you wanted.

05:02.690 --> 05:05.490
Hey! How about you come out 
where we can see you?

05:10.290 --> 05:12.990
Seeing as how you didn't 
just start shooting,

05:12.990 --> 05:15.250
I imagine you didn't come to fight.

05:15.710 --> 05:18.210
They're the Lulus?

05:18.760 --> 05:22.550
As expected from a leader 
of the empire's warriors.

05:23.370 --> 05:27.680
Girl, you're the one who came 
here during the day, right?

05:27.930 --> 05:30.560
Th-That's correct. I am...

05:30.560 --> 05:33.900
Girl, where did you get this?

05:35.650 --> 05:36.270
That's...

05:36.800 --> 05:39.480
I asked you where you got it.

05:39.910 --> 05:41.730
Depending on your answer...

05:45.360 --> 05:48.760
Just so you know, I can't have 
you do anything too untoward.

05:49.430 --> 05:52.370
You stand in the presence of
 Her Highness, Princess of the Empire.

05:52.640 --> 05:56.540
I would have to protect her. 
That's my duty, anyway.

05:58.640 --> 06:01.500
Depending on your actions, 
I would show no mercy.

06:02.040 --> 06:03.460
Why, you...

06:03.700 --> 06:05.700
<i>This is fantastic!</i>

06:05.700 --> 06:07.820
<i>To think, he killed me, and now here he is,</i>

06:07.820 --> 06:11.930
<i>about to put is life on 
the line to defend me!</i>

06:12.180 --> 06:14.040
By the way, Your Highness,

06:14.040 --> 06:18.060
I trust you've devised a means of 
getting this situation under control.

06:18.060 --> 06:18.970
Huh?

06:19.520 --> 06:21.880
Am I permitted to kill or not?

06:21.880 --> 06:24.970
Do I engage or retreat?

06:24.970 --> 06:30.240
If this was also part of your calculations, 
I'd appreciate some instructions.

06:31.560 --> 06:34.000
<i>The meaning of this smile is thus:</i>

06:34.000 --> 06:36.950
<i>If you haven't thought about it,
 I'm gonna let you have it.</i>

06:36.950 --> 06:38.600
<i>What am I thinking?!</i>

06:38.600 --> 06:41.850
<i>Those people seem exceedingly angry,</i>

06:41.850 --> 06:44.640
<i>and this man isn't exactly a 
subordinate who swears loyalty to me.</i>

06:44.640 --> 06:46.710
<i>If anything, I'd have to say he's... a foe?</i>

06:47.050 --> 06:48.670
Everyone, stop! Please.

06:49.050 --> 06:51.140
Why, that's... Liora?!

06:51.390 --> 06:55.100
Your Highness, a pleasure... 
to... see you again.

06:55.530 --> 06:59.840
See, this man is Lulus chief. Yes.

06:59.840 --> 07:01.060
And this...

07:01.320 --> 07:05.040
I gave this hairpin to my wife as a gift.

07:05.040 --> 07:08.030
And after she died, my daughter inherited it.

07:08.420 --> 07:10.760
Your daughter, you say...

07:13.020 --> 07:15.820
I regret to have to inform you of this,

07:16.840 --> 07:21.570
but I'm afraid your daughter has passed away.

07:21.990 --> 07:22.960
She died?

07:23.470 --> 07:28.710
I received the hairpin from who 
I assume is your grandchild.

07:29.250 --> 07:33.930
I found him collapsed in the slums and 
aided him. He gave it to me as thanks.

07:36.290 --> 07:40.730
Chief, Her Highness is not liar. No.

07:41.030 --> 07:44.690
It was also Her Highness who 
had our forces withdraw.

07:45.360 --> 07:48.740
Girl kicked our tree!

07:48.740 --> 07:53.000
Militaries need a suitable 
reason to withdraw forces.

07:53.000 --> 07:56.070
I believe a chief would 
understand what I mean.

07:57.670 --> 07:59.010
I do.

07:59.010 --> 08:02.540
But that doesn't mean I can 
simply believe all you say.

08:02.540 --> 08:04.790
This is an opportunity!

08:05.060 --> 08:09.040
In that case, I can have him come here.

08:09.040 --> 08:13.850
I don't believe remaining in the 
slums is what's best for him anyway.

08:13.850 --> 08:16.510
You can make your judgment afterwards.

08:16.940 --> 08:18.050
Bull—

08:25.350 --> 08:29.770
She bravely entered enemy territory 
with only one subordinate.

08:29.770 --> 08:32.150
I doubt she would lie.

08:32.650 --> 08:34.690
Thank you for helping my grandchild.

08:35.240 --> 08:38.180
I apologize for our earlier affronts.

08:38.180 --> 08:39.640
Quite unnecessary.

08:41.040 --> 08:46.080
I did kick one of the 
precious trees of your forest.

08:46.650 --> 08:50.130
Why don't we just say we're even?

08:50.880 --> 08:55.180
More importantly, just be 
kind to your grandson.

08:57.500 --> 09:02.480
<i>It's best for him to return to this 
forest rather than remain in the slums.</i>

09:02.480 --> 09:06.020
<i>There's no telling what sparks the 
flames of the conflict, after all.</i>

09:09.570 --> 09:13.990
<i>I was bound by my stubbornness 
and pride as chief...</i>

09:14.250 --> 09:19.990
<i>I couldn't abide my daughter's desire 
to be with a man from another tribe...</i>

09:20.460 --> 09:24.710
<i>I can at least avoid making that 
mistake with my grandson.</i>

09:24.710 --> 09:27.870
<i>This young princess is warning me of that.</i>

09:29.450 --> 09:33.050
I am much obliged for the 
consideration you've shown.

09:33.990 --> 09:36.510
<i>There could never be a coincidence like this.</i>

09:37.030 --> 09:40.160
<i>She had the information before 
we came to the forest.</i>

09:40.620 --> 09:43.980
<i>Even her dropping the hairpin 
might have been intentional...</i>

09:45.030 --> 09:46.940
<i>Wisdom of the Empire, eh?</i>

09:47.800 --> 09:52.310
<i>I suppose this princess is worth 
me putting in some effort.</i>

09:54.480 --> 10:00.860
<i>The next day, Mia, who had returned to the capital, 
was summoned by her father, the emperor.</i>

10:01.900 --> 10:04.580
A pleasure to see you, Your Majesty.

10:04.870 --> 10:08.660
Oh, my beloved daughter, Mia.

10:08.660 --> 10:10.580
There is no need to call me "Your Majesty."

10:10.580 --> 10:14.550
You could just call me me "Father," 
or even "Papa." Okay?

10:15.360 --> 10:18.380
So then, Father, 
what did you wish to discuss?

10:18.910 --> 10:22.980
I'm told you went to the conflict zone
 in Viscount Berman's lands.

10:22.980 --> 10:26.190
I nearly fainted from 
the shock of hearing it.

10:26.190 --> 10:29.730
My goodness. Let me reassure you. 
I was not in the slightest danger.

10:29.730 --> 10:31.840
You may say that,

10:31.840 --> 10:36.070
but I'm told you returned with all 
the soldiers in the area in tow.

10:36.070 --> 10:37.360
<i>Oh, my...</i>

10:37.360 --> 10:40.800
<i>Who was it that blabbed 
that unnecessary detail?</i>

10:41.490 --> 10:43.710
It's an embarrassing story, really.

10:43.710 --> 10:47.450
I caught my foot on a tree and tripped, 
and I completely panicked.

10:47.760 --> 10:48.790
What?!

10:48.790 --> 10:51.720
What a vile tree to dare trip you, Mia!

10:51.720 --> 10:53.820
Burn it down! The whole forest!

10:53.820 --> 10:55.810
No, Father.

10:55.810 --> 11:00.050
I've taken quite a liking to that forest!

11:00.050 --> 11:02.690
Is it really that wonderful?

11:02.690 --> 11:03.510
Oh, yes.

11:03.970 --> 11:09.980
And so, Father, I should very much like 
to have that forest made part of my lands.

11:10.440 --> 11:15.940
<i>Making the Forest of Stillness the 
princess's land certainly would save it.</i>

11:16.280 --> 11:20.310
<i>But it would also definitely incur 
Viscount Berman's resentment.</i>

11:20.790 --> 11:22.450
<i>This is an incomplete solution.</i>

11:23.900 --> 11:27.870
<i>Have I been overestimating Princess Mia?</i>

11:28.540 --> 11:32.230
<i>Could it be that she has 
no particular wisdom?</i>

11:32.230 --> 11:33.690
<i>That she is no saint?</i>

11:34.330 --> 11:39.600
<i>He had finally realized the truth, 
the fog steadily lifting from his glasses...</i>

11:39.600 --> 11:40.840
<i>When...</i>

11:41.190 --> 11:46.000
Then, Berman, establish
 "Princess Town" next to the forest.

11:46.000 --> 11:48.310
You shall build a castle for Mia.

11:50.110 --> 11:51.920
<i>That's throwing fuel on the fire!</i>

11:51.920 --> 11:54.220
<i>Not only were his lands reduced,</i>

11:54.220 --> 11:57.950
<i>but he also has to build a town at his 
own expense and a castle on top of that!</i>

11:58.610 --> 12:01.570
Your Majesty, I am overjoyed!

12:02.510 --> 12:05.990
I, Berman, shall faithfully devote my all

12:05.990 --> 12:08.990
to carry out the great honor 
you have bestowed upon me!

12:09.560 --> 12:13.710
<i>Of course! Aristocrats are creatures 
that prize honor above all else.</i>

12:14.130 --> 12:17.410
<i>The territory issue pales in comparison</i>

12:17.410 --> 12:20.050
<i>to the honor of managing one of 
the imperial princess's lands.</i>

12:20.350 --> 12:23.730
<i>Princess Mia truly is the 
Wisdom of the Empire.</i>

12:23.730 --> 12:27.060
<i>I am ashamed to have doubted 
her for even a second!</i>

12:27.060 --> 12:29.930
<i>Don't be. You were close.</i>

12:32.020 --> 12:37.230
Come to think of it, I haven't received 
any letters from Prince Abel lately.

12:39.360 --> 12:41.440
Princess Mia, you have a letter.

12:41.830 --> 12:43.440
From Prince Abel?

12:43.440 --> 12:45.910
No. It's from Lady Tiona.

12:49.830 --> 12:54.290
Hm... Tiona's younger brother, eh...

12:55.290 --> 12:58.710
"Saint of the Revolutionary Army, 
Tiona Rudolvon, shares food supply"

12:58.710 --> 13:02.320
"with the populace suffering 
under the famine."

13:03.340 --> 13:07.590
How does that woman have so much food?

13:07.590 --> 13:11.260
Have you not heard that a new variety 
of wheat has been developed?

13:11.740 --> 13:13.980
A new variety of wheat?

13:14.270 --> 13:17.910
Lady Tiona's younger brother, 
Cyril Rudolvon,

13:17.910 --> 13:20.080
has developed a cold-hardy variety of wheat.

13:20.080 --> 13:22.650
Nobody told me anything about that!

13:22.650 --> 13:26.210
Well, Lord Cyril was working under 
Princess Rafina's protection

13:26.210 --> 13:29.240
in a research institution in the 
Holy Principality of Belluga.

13:29.710 --> 13:31.200
That's not fair!

13:31.200 --> 13:34.940
Why can't I have a brilliant younger brother?

13:36.460 --> 13:39.250
Cyril Rudolvon the child prodigy.

13:39.250 --> 13:41.290
The unfair brother.

13:41.580 --> 13:43.260
Is something the matter?

13:43.770 --> 13:46.780
It's Miss Tiona's younger brother.

13:46.780 --> 13:48.700
He's very brilliant, but apparently,

13:48.700 --> 13:52.560
he is unable to attend school 
due to financial difficulties.

13:52.560 --> 13:53.270
Oh, my...

13:53.730 --> 13:59.230
So they're asking me to intercede 
with Princess Rafina.

13:59.480 --> 14:00.650
I see.

14:00.650 --> 14:05.940
To allow her younger brother to study 
abroad in the Holy Principality, too.

14:06.500 --> 14:07.490
Of course.

14:07.940 --> 14:09.870
Naturally, I shall do no such thing.

14:10.180 --> 14:10.850
Huh?

14:12.360 --> 14:14.330
It's just what I expect from Her Highness.

14:14.940 --> 14:18.820
To resolve the incident without a 
single drop of blood being shed.

14:18.820 --> 14:22.790
Her wisdom was exceptional 
even at the academy.

14:23.240 --> 14:25.350
Father, you're not upset?

14:25.350 --> 14:28.010
The forest land was unjustly taken from you.

14:28.270 --> 14:30.050
It wasn't taken unjustly.

14:30.050 --> 14:33.450
The members of the imperial household 
have the authority to do that.

14:34.160 --> 14:38.730
Most importantly, if the people don't have 
to suffer, then it's not a bad thing.

14:38.730 --> 14:40.540
I see...

14:40.540 --> 14:43.690
So then why is Her Highness 
Princess Mia coming here?

14:44.050 --> 14:48.530
I would imagine it has something to do with 
that incident in the forest the other day.

14:48.840 --> 14:51.400
I know she sent a letter,

14:51.400 --> 14:54.740
but for her to actually come all 
the way out here in person...

14:55.130 --> 14:56.780
It's so like her.

15:00.170 --> 15:04.590
<i>Father and Tiona think so 
highly of Princess Mia.</i>

15:04.590 --> 15:06.290
<i>I wonder what she's like...</i>

15:06.800 --> 15:10.090
My, these are quite the lovely flowers.

15:10.870 --> 15:14.450
I want to say they're 
sweetmoons. Is that correct?

15:17.920 --> 15:20.520
Uh... huh... That's correct.

15:20.870 --> 15:22.980
Princess Mia, it's time.

15:23.440 --> 15:25.940
<i>Princess Mia?! Th-This is </i>her?!<i></i>

15:32.360 --> 15:34.820
<i>Winding a little backwards in time...</i>

15:37.040 --> 15:39.100
A boy admiring flowers...

15:39.890 --> 15:42.530
<i>If he created a new variety of wheat,</i>

15:42.530 --> 15:44.700
<i>that must mean he's 
well-versed in growing plants.</i>

15:44.700 --> 15:46.800
<i>Flower equals plant!</i>

15:45.790 --> 15:46.800
<b>Plant</b>

15:46.800 --> 15:49.630
<b>Cyril</b>

15:46.800 --> 15:49.630
<i>That boy is him! Cyril Rudolvon!</i>

15:50.030 --> 15:52.970
<i>That should score me some points.</i>

15:54.400 --> 16:00.720
I thank Your Highness again for the favor 
you have shown my daughter at the academy.

16:00.720 --> 16:03.440
Truly, I didn't do much.

16:03.440 --> 16:06.770
And with the incident in the 
Forest of Stillness, as well...

16:07.100 --> 16:09.790
I have a more important matter 
to discuss, Count Rudolvon.

16:09.790 --> 16:13.740
I have come with a proposal for you.

16:14.170 --> 16:16.700
Oh? A proposal, you say?

16:16.990 --> 16:20.660
I hear your son, Cyril, 
is a very sagacious boy.

16:22.510 --> 16:27.110
Are you perhaps saying you 
can put in a good word

16:27.110 --> 16:28.960
to allow Cyril to attend Saint Noel Academy?

16:29.240 --> 16:34.860
No. To deliberately allow the empire's 
great talent to drain to other nations...

16:34.860 --> 16:37.180
I mustn't commit such folly.

16:38.480 --> 16:40.410
Then, what do you propose?

16:40.410 --> 16:45.380
Perhaps you've heard that Viscount Berman 
is establishing Princess Town?

16:45.380 --> 16:47.150
Oh. Yes.

16:47.420 --> 16:51.830
I am of a mind to build 
a school in that town.

16:51.830 --> 16:53.720
A school, Your Highness?

16:53.720 --> 16:58.770
Yes. What if the empire also 
had an academy like Saint Noel?

16:58.770 --> 17:00.120
Wouldn't that be wonderful?

17:02.470 --> 17:03.930
What do you think?

17:03.930 --> 17:09.540
Would you be interested in having Cyril 
be the very first student at my school?

17:09.870 --> 17:11.000
<i>Me?</i>

17:11.460 --> 17:14.240
<i>That would be close enough 
to attend from here.</i>

17:14.240 --> 17:17.280
<i>And if it's state-run, then the 
tuition should be affordable.</i>

17:17.750 --> 17:21.970
<i>It's the perfect thing for House Rudolvon, 
given our financial difficulties.</i>

17:23.270 --> 17:26.440
You honor us beyond our station 
to show us such consideration.

17:27.020 --> 17:31.520
If there is <i>anything</i> we can 
do thank you, just say the word.

17:31.780 --> 17:36.150
In that case, I would like 
your stores of wheat.

17:36.540 --> 17:39.160
What? Our... wheat?

17:39.520 --> 17:41.860
Instead of selling it cheaply,
 as you usually do,

17:41.860 --> 17:45.140
I'd like you to store as much as possible.

17:45.140 --> 17:47.830
Then, in the event of a famine—

17:47.830 --> 17:52.420
Of course, by your command, 
we'd supply it to the royal family.

17:52.960 --> 17:56.260
That is not my request, Count Rudolvon.

17:56.260 --> 17:59.720
<i>If I did that, I'd just incur 
the resentment of the populace.</i>

18:00.630 --> 18:06.000
I'd like the Rudolvon family to distribute 
the wheat directly to the people.

18:06.000 --> 18:09.440
And if I could have you use 
my name when you do so...

18:09.680 --> 18:14.150
Oh. You mean, we would have your 
permission to use your name?

18:14.470 --> 18:20.120
Indeed. By all means, I'd like you 
to do it extensively under my name.

18:22.100 --> 18:24.080
I am in awe of your graciousness.

18:24.430 --> 18:25.210
<i>Huh?</i>

18:26.370 --> 18:28.600
<i>There have been many years with poor harvest.</i>

18:28.600 --> 18:33.000
<i>Whenever it happened, the great houses 
would show up and take our wheat.</i>

18:33.410 --> 18:36.800
<i>And when I tried to distribute 
it to the people for free,</i>

18:36.800 --> 18:38.470
<i>they would always say,</i>

18:38.470 --> 18:41.140
<i>"This is an act of rebellion 
against the empire!"</i>

18:41.500 --> 18:45.070
<i>Her Highness has spoken 
in anticipation of that.</i>

18:45.070 --> 18:47.980
<i>She's saying to carry it out under the 
authority of the imperial princess!</i>

18:48.480 --> 18:52.720
<i>Oh, what great wisdom! 
What bountiful benevolence!</i>

18:52.720 --> 18:53.440
<i>What?!</i>

18:53.910 --> 18:55.760
<i>What's with this reaction?</i>

18:55.760 --> 19:01.740
<i>I'm essentially telling him to do all the 
hard work and then give me all the credit!</i>

19:02.050 --> 19:05.700
<i>Mia's heart was secretly 
pounding in that moment.</i>

19:06.950 --> 19:09.620
Let me say this to avoid 
any misunderstandings.

19:09.620 --> 19:11.580
The school Cyril would attend

19:11.900 --> 19:16.050
would not have the sort of extravagance 
of the schools the great houses patronize.

19:16.270 --> 19:22.010
It would accept students widely, including 
from the neighboring Lulus and common folk.

19:22.350 --> 19:26.620
<i>So it's not as if I'm deliberately 
giving your son special treatment.</i>

19:26.620 --> 19:29.850
<i>That was the intention of 
Mia's words. However...</i>

19:29.850 --> 19:34.310
I cannot express the depth of my 
gratitude for your thoughtfulness.

19:34.640 --> 19:35.860
<i>What?!</i>

19:36.160 --> 19:38.560
<i>She's going to arrange an environment</i>

19:38.560 --> 19:43.360
<i>where Cyril can learn without worrying 
about the children from the great houses.</i>

19:43.360 --> 19:47.830
<i>And what's more, she's taken friendly 
relations with the Lulus into account...</i>

19:48.090 --> 19:50.570
D-Do you think he's one of <i>those?</i>

19:50.570 --> 19:56.350
You know, the type that enjoys 
being bullied or made to feel pain?

19:56.350 --> 19:57.300
What?

19:57.750 --> 20:01.630
<i>Wow. Princess Mia's not only 
beautiful but sagacious as well!</i>

20:01.900 --> 20:05.710
<i>W-Well, not only did 
I keep Cyril in my hands,</i>

20:05.710 --> 20:10.100
<i>but the Rudolvons' grain 
is now essentially mine.</i>

20:10.400 --> 20:13.560
<i>Everything turned out okay 
in the end. Magnificently so.</i>

20:16.960 --> 20:20.340
That kind of thing makes a girl tired.

20:21.830 --> 20:25.680
<i>Now that I think about it, 
I haven't been checking lately...</i>

20:42.710 --> 20:46.150
What... What's going on?

20:46.150 --> 20:48.130
Why did my diary vanish?

20:48.130 --> 20:52.140
How am I supposed to 
avoid the guillotine without it?!

20:53.610 --> 20:55.120
Wait. Hold on.

20:55.120 --> 20:56.470
That's backwards.

20:56.470 --> 21:01.680
As long as that diary exists, it's certain 
that I'll be put to the guillotine,

21:01.680 --> 21:04.860
and now that the diary 
vanished, that means...

21:05.310 --> 21:08.830
Maybe the guillotine future 
has vanished as well!

21:09.100 --> 21:10.350
I did it!

21:10.350 --> 21:12.660
I finally did it!

21:12.660 --> 21:16.410
I want to share this joy 
with someone right away!

21:16.410 --> 21:21.250
But the person I most want to 
share it with is Prince Abel!

21:26.640 --> 21:30.140
It appears the empire is going to recover.

21:30.450 --> 21:36.400
Sounds like that kid Ludwig in the 
Gold Moon Ministry is fairly exceptional.

21:36.400 --> 21:39.360
I really thought a food shortage 
would take care of it.

21:39.850 --> 21:44.070
And I hear Princess Mia and 
Prince Sion's relationship is excellent.

21:44.490 --> 21:47.780
We probably ought to consider the 
efforts to divide them a failure.

21:48.630 --> 21:52.740
The Wisdom of the Empire, huh.
 What a vexing brat.

21:53.240 --> 21:57.210
No matter. It doesn't change what we must do.

21:57.920 --> 22:01.420
We'll put the plans against 
the empire on hold.

22:01.900 --> 22:03.650
We're changing targets.

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
Illustration by: Kaoru Harugano
